<title>USA: Entergy sees 1996 net EPS $1.82 - $1.86.</title>
<headline>Entergy sees 1996 net EPS $1.82 - $1.86.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Entergy Corp said Thursday ongoing earnings estimates for the year of $2.46 to $2.50 per share -- or $1.82 to $1.86, including a first-quarter write-off of $0.76 per share for its River Bend nuclear plant -- are reasonable.</p>
<p>Earlier Thursday the company reported third quarter earnings of $1.22 per share including gains, compared with a year-ago figure of $1.16 per share.  The company reported earnings from ongoing operations of $1.10 per share.</p>
</text>
